VISUAL: Joel holding a curved metal part, discussing it with Mark.
AUDIO: 'similar to a forging, this is what we\'re kind of in the market for is working in high performance applications where material properties are really valuable. And in those applications, you\'re always going to need postmachining.'

[07:38] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'always right. So you\'re we\'re not really changing anything in the workflow of how you would go through the manufacturing process. &gt;&gt; Oh. Oh yeah. Because in other additive processes, you\'re still creating net shapes and you\'re having to machine them'

[07:50] [scene:talk]
